  "rdfs:comment": {
    "de": [
      "Reiseleiter und zertifizierter Sporttrainer, der in Cercié en Beaujolais wohnt. Praktiziert Wandern, Sport- und Nordic Walking, Trailrunning, Radfahren, Mountainbiking und Vae."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Tourist guide and certified sports coach living in Cercié in Beaujolais. Practice of walking, sports and Nordic walking, trail, cycling, mountain biking and electrically assisted bicycle."
    ],
    "it": [
      "Guida turistica e allenatore sportivo certificato che vive a Cercié en Beaujolais. Pratica la camminata, lo sport e il nordic walking, il trail, il ciclismo, la mountain bike e il Vae."
    ],
    "fr": [
      "Guide touristique et coach sportif certifié habitant Cercié en Beaujolais. Pratique de la marche, marche sportive et nordique, trail, vélo, VTT et Vae."
